{"v":1,"id":"9b44d60d68fd","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"I’ve traveled through the valleys,","s":13.19,"e":16.24},{"t":"And shadows pulled me in.","s":16.34,"e":19.31},{"t":"The weight of all my failures","s":19.37,"e":21.8},{"t":"Pressed against my skin.","s":21.84,"e":25.17},{"t":"But when the storm was roaring,","s":25.27,"e":28.15},{"t":"I heard You call my name—","s":28.27,"e":31.08},{"t":"And every wall around me","s":31.18,"e":33.53},{"t":"Shattered in the flame.","s":33.61,"e":37.33},{"t":"All the chains that bound me","s":37.39,"e":39.44},{"t":"Started breaking loose…","s":39.53,"e":42.87},{"t":"Your mercy like a thunder","s":42.95,"e":45.42},{"t":"Tearing through the gloom.","s":45.5,"e":47.23},{"t":"When You lift me from the waves,","s":47.26,"e":50.89},{"t":"I can breathe again.","s":51.01,"e":53.05},{"t":"When the light breaks through the rain,","s":53.1,"e":56.58},{"t":"Hope comes rushing in.","s":56.64,"e":58.94},{"t":"I was lost, but now I stand—","s":59.06,"e":61.86},{"t":"You restored my heart with grace.","s":61.94,"e":64.79},{"t":"All I am is in Your hands","s":64.85,"e":68.24},{"t":"When You lift me from the waves.","s":68.3,"e":75.42},{"t":"I ran from every whisper,","s":75.5,"e":77.43},{"t":"Afraid of what You’d find—","s":77.44,"e":81.33},{"t":"But still Your love kept reaching,","s":81.4,"e":83.56},{"t":"Refusing to leave me behind.","s":83.64,"e":87.23},{"t":"Now fire fills the places","s":87.31,"e":90.02},{"t":"Where emptiness had been.","s":90.1,"e":93.12},{"t":"Your promise is my fortress,","s":93.18,"e":95.39},{"t":"My strength to rise again.","s":95.5,"e":99.61},{"t":"Every fear that bound me","s":99.65,"e":101.51},{"t":"Falls beneath Your truth…","s":101.61,"e":104.93},{"t":"Your freedom shakes my spirit,","s":104.99,"e":107.5},{"t":"Making all things new.","s":107.58,"e":108.93},{"t":"Chorus","s":108.97,"e":109.2},{"t":"When You lift me from the waves,","s":109.23,"e":112.8},{"t":"I can breathe again.","s":1